 k\, encouragement and inspiration?\nThe group meets twice monthly: on the
  first Tuesday of each month and again on the  third Thursday of each mon
 th.\nEveryone is welcome.\nThe circle is currently full.. If you wish to 
 join the group\, put your name on the\nwait-list\n- the Circle Lead will c
 ontact you as soon as a spot becomes available.\nPlease note\n: marking yo
 urself "interested" in the program only creates a bookmark in your account
  - it does not result in your contact information being forwarded to the 
 Circle Lead.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on 
