DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260426T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260426T153000
UID:69948e1db0595799c09d7421@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Create a more sophisticated PowerPoint 2019 presentation with 
 more advanced features.\nIn this first session\, you will:\nCrop pictures\
 , add picture borders and add picture effects.\nAlign and distribute objec
 ts.\nInsert and edit SmartArt graphics.\nAnimate objects.\nEdit a theme.\n
 Prerequisites: PowerPoint Basics 1 and 2 or equivalent experience. Basic 
 keyboarding and mouse skills required.\nFormat: Hands-on with demonstratio
 ns\nPlease arrive a few minutes early.\nInformation Collection Notice\n: T
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
  The information will only be used for event and program registration\, de
 livery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your inform
 ation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-39
 7-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Learning Centre\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69948e1db0595799c09d7421
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
