DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260423T193000
UID:69b8092c81b67dfe32acdeac@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Certified tea sommelier\, Soo Park\, guides audiences on a jou
 rney learning and experiencing Korean tea and culture along with Korean te
 a history and tradition. Experience the Korean tea ceremony Darye and tast
 e samples of different types of Korean teas during the program.\nOnline re
 gistration is required beginning April 1st.\nThis is a program for  adult
 s.
