 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization. Upcoming guests at Lillian H. Smith branch:\nApril
 : YES (Youth Employment Services)\nMay: Toronto Elections\nJune: Asian Com
 munity AIDS Services - BIPOC Harm Reduction program *please note: date ha
 s changed to June 19*\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all partic
 ipants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.
