UID:69d691854dacf581ff876869@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Air transport pilot\, flight instructor\, traveler and photogr
 apher\, Lola Reid Allin\, presents her memoir\,\nHIGHWAY TO THE SKY: An Av
 iator's Journey\n(Simon & Schuster\; September\, 2024)\,\nIn 1980\, Lola e
 arned her commercial pilot license and become one of a few women in Canada
  licensed to fly for hire and reward. Lola explains the rewards of an avia
 tion career and the challenges faced by women\, then and now.\nInformation
  Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by
