BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Book Launch: Michael DeForge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T200000
UID:69bc130c67801235ed732c4d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Michael DeForge\ncontinues his creative winning streak with hi
 s second collection of short stories\,\nAll the Cameras in My Room\n. Join
  Michael in conversation with filmmaker and author\nJustin Decloux\n.\nThe
  prolific cartoonist’s hilarious approach to comics fiction never disapp
 oints. His stories break down how we consume pop culture\, interrogate our
  relationship to star power and recontextualize our nostalgia into a share
 d mythology\, cementing his place as the most consistent and beguiling car
 toonist working today.\nDrop in\, no reservation required.\nBooks will be
  available for purchase by The Beguiling.\nBirds of Maine\nHoly Lacrimony
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, In basement program room B/C
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bc130c67801235ed732c4d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
