DESCRIPTION:Intended for adults\, this workshop requires the use of a stap
 le gun. Stretching your own canvas is a practice of making and preparing y
 our work before you begin to create. In this workshop you will learn how t
 o take apart a canvas and stretch a new canvas or other textiles to the wo
 od frame. A guide tutorial of best practices\, tool safety\, and fabric se
 lection will equip you with the skills to expand your creative practice.\n
 Information Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is c
 ollected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, se
